&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="25518" data-local-id="2d89814a"&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: &lt;/strong&gt;Please note: If the applicant is permanently present outside the UK, Veeam reserves the right to decline consideration of the application for the job. A remote job is only possible in case the employee is located in the UK&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-JK1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice="1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]" data-en-clipboard="true"&gt;
