arbeitnow:strategic-account-director-fin:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sayari:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sayari is the judgment infrastructure for trustworthy AI in economic security and commercial risk. The Sayari Commercial World Model resolves 11.7B+ primary-source records from 250+ jurisdictions forming the ground truth of global commerce. A Judgment Ontology, encoding over a decade of investigative tradecraft, and Superconductor, an agentic orchestration platform, deliver AI that reasons like an expert analyst, shows its work, and traces every finding to its source. Trusted by U.S. Customs and Border Protection, HM Revenue &amp;amp; Customs, and Fortune 500 enterprises, Sayari is used by thousands of professionals across 35+ countries to secure supply chains and dismantle illicit networks. Headquartered in Washington, D.C., with offices in London, Singapore, Tokyo, and Tel Aviv.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;POSITION DESCRIPTION:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7"&gt;Sayari is seeking a seasoned, elite &lt;strong data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="36"&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; and business development professional with an undeniable, proven history of selling to and managing complex relationships within &lt;strong data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="194"&gt;Tier 1 Banks, Global Insurers, and Multinational Financial Institutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="8"&gt;In this role, you will own a high-value book of business comprising Tier 1 commercial accounts based in the EMEA Region. You will be given a direct mandate to navigate the sophisticated, matrixed ecosystems of global financial enterprises—driving deep product adoption, securing high-value renewals, and aggressively executing net-new revenue expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;JOB RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Strategic Account Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a deep understanding of Tier 1 client mission sets, map complex account whitespace, and build strategic account plans to scale revenue through targeted upsell and cross-sale activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Forecast Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain immaculate, up-to-date Salesforce data for your territory, providing reliable, data-driven forecast information directly to upper management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Advocacy &amp;amp; Net New Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Capitalize on existing relationships to drive referral sales and cultivate strong customer references to support broader net-new sales initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Market &amp;amp; Competitive Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay hyper-aware of competitive movements, regulatory shifts (risk/compliance/supply chain), and market trends within the banking and insurance sectors to provide actionable feedback to leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="11,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Pre-Sales, Legal, and InfoSec teams to smoothly navigate complex financial procurement cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;SKILLS &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;blockquote data-path-to-node="14"&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="14,0"&gt;Candidates must possess a documented, referenceable track record of successfully selling risk, compliance, or intelligence solutions directly into Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="15"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of field sales or enterprise account management experience, specifically working with &lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="116"&gt;enterprise risk, compliance, corporate intelligence, or supply chain mapping vendors&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Tier 1 Financial Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise navigating the unique buying behaviors, regulatory hurdles, and procurement frameworks of G-SIBs (Global Systemically Important Banks) and top-tier insurance carriers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="15,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; A consistent, verifiable history of meeting and exceeding high-value enterprise revenue expectations and quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="15,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Superior written, verbal, and presentation skills, comfortable pitching to C-suite stakeholders (CROs, CCOs, CISOs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="15,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="15,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability and willingness to travel up to 25% to meet clients and attend key industry events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Private Healthcare &amp;amp; Wellness:&lt;/strong&gt; 100% fully paid private medical, dental, and vision cover for employees and their dependants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Generous Annual Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday, plus all UK bank holidays, and a company-wide shutdown between Christmas and New Year's Eve, in addition to 10 sick days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Workplace Pension:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly competitive pension scheme with an 8% company match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Life Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; 100% company-paid life insurance cover for peace of mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Socials &amp;amp; Work Events:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular team events, socials, and company gatherings to celebrate our wins and stay connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,5,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,5,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Outstanding Compensation Package:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive commissions for revenue roles and quarterly bonuses for non-revenue positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,6,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,6,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Enhanced Parental Leave:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive support for new parents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,7,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,7,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;A Collaborative &amp;amp; Positive Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong commitment to diversity, equity, and inclusion—working alongside a team as smart and driven as you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="3,8,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="3,8,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Limitless Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuous learning and professional development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sayari is an equal opportunity employer and strongly encourages diverse candidates to apply. We believe diversity and inclusion mean our team members should reflect the diversity of the United States. No employee or applicant will face discrimination or harassment based on race, color, ethnicity, religion, age, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, disability status, veteran status, genetics, or political affiliation. We strongly encourage applicants of all backgrounds to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:software-engineer-integrations:
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, giving businesses complete visibility and control over all traffic—human, bot, or AI. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome's multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily to analyze intent and stop fraud in under 2 milliseconds—letting legitimate users through seamlessly across websites, apps, APIs, and MCPs. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 30+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering protection that outperforms.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome's Integrations team&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for delivering the software components integrated by our customers to send traffic to DataDome for analysis and run challenges on clients identified as threats. The team is currently made up of &lt;strong&gt;8 engineers (server-side and client-side)&lt;/strong&gt; and is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who thrives on technical challenges and will help us develop new integrations and improve our current ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to our roadmap with your teammates and work in strong collaboration with product managers and engineers across different teams (Tech, Customer Experience, Solutions Engineering).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer (Integrations)…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You will be in charge of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing and maintaining DataDome's JavaScript Tag&lt;/strong&gt;, our client-side integration deployed across hundreds of customer websites, with a focus on performance, resilience, security, and privacy. You will care about Core Web Vitals and the impact of our tag on customer pages. This will be your primary area of focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building and improving server-side integration modules&lt;/strong&gt; for JavaScript-based edge platforms and runtimes such as &lt;strong&gt;AWS Lambda@Edge, Cloudflare Workers, Fastly Compute&lt;/strong&gt;, Node.js, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking ownership of backend integration modules&lt;/strong&gt; in other languages (Python, Go, Java, Ruby), helping customers integrate DataDome into their server-side infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving technical direction and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; for integration components, and mentoring other engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raising the bar on code quality and release standards&lt;/strong&gt; by driving improvements in CI/CD pipelines, testing, performance, and security across all integration components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Providing technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to our Support and Solutions Engineering teams (Tier 2/3) to help onboard customers and resolve complex integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staying on the cutting edge&lt;/strong&gt; by monitoring technological developments in web technologies, edge computing, and server-side runtimes, and proposing improvements to our integrations accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing incidents and post-incident reviews&lt;/strong&gt; related to integration components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;You will be the perfect candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;at least 5 years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;strong JavaScript/TypeScript skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including familiarity with modern web standards and server-side JS runtimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;solid working proficiency in at least one other backend language&lt;/strong&gt; (Python, Go, Java, Ruby).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;web protocols and standards&lt;/strong&gt; (HTTP, TCP, cookies, DNS, TLS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to &lt;strong&gt;assess trade-offs across different integration approaches&lt;/strong&gt; and propose solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience &lt;strong&gt;mentoring other engineers or driving technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt; within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about &lt;strong&gt;performance, code quality, and automation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working across different &lt;strong&gt;codebases, languages, and platforms&lt;/strong&gt; rather than specializing in a single stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are willing to &lt;strong&gt;learn and adopt new technologies&lt;/strong&gt; regularly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have good &lt;strong&gt;communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and are fluent in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt; who enjoys collaborating with others and contributing to a supportive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;edge computing platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (Cloudflare Workers, AWS Lambda@Edge, Fastly Compute, Deno Deploy, Vercel Edge Functions, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with &lt;strong&gt;CDNs, load balancers, or web servers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;cloud providers&lt;/strong&gt; such as AWS or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the inner workings of &lt;strong&gt;browsers and JavaScript engines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with &lt;strong&gt;ECMAScript and Web standards&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;security topics&lt;/strong&gt; such as CSP, iframe sandboxing, bot detection, or web application security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on &lt;strong&gt;compilers and/or parsers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have prior experience in &lt;strong&gt;cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have developed your own &lt;strong&gt;bots&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Career path&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed to grow into a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; position within the Integrations team. You will progressively take on broader technical ownership across the team's scope, influence architectural decisions, and become a key technical reference for both internal teams and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;By joining DataDome, you will have access to:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; This position is &lt;strong&gt;open to fully remote candidates based anywhere in France&lt;/strong&gt;. You can also work from our Parisian office located next to the Opera Garnier, or go hybrid. You will receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF discount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of 200€ if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #WeAimHigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building:&lt;/strong&gt; Feel the Team Spirit both virtually and onsite, with several events and workshops planned throughout the year, including an annual offsite event, quarterly online and offline events and parties, lunch &amp;amp; learns, and much more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based in (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Talent Acquisition Manager will contact you for a first chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will then meet with Dara (Engineering Manager)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will complete a technical test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The final step will be a one-on-one meeting with Gilles (CTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome to DataDome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and proud to be committed to diversity and inclusion. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:principal-technical-seo-specia:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Legend&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Legend is a world-leading sports and gaming media network, reaching hundreds of millions of visitors a year. We're now part of Genius Sports. Together, we’re combining Legend’s audience, brands and product expertise with Genius Sports’ real-time data, technology and capabilities to create the next generation of fan-facing media and advertising. Learn more at &lt;a href="l1.com"&gt;l1.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Legend, we're building next-level player experiences. With 20+ years of proven success we’re the world's leading Sports and Gaming marketing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are our edge. 600+ sharp, ambitious Legends across 22+ countries who move fast, learn quickly and win together. Here growth isn’t a perk, it’s the standard. You’ll stretch, level-up and carve out a career as bold as the products we build. We celebrate wins and create experiences that people talk about for years - for our players &amp;amp; for each other. If you’re ready to shape the future of player experience and enjoy the ride while you do it, this is where you’ll thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Legend is hiring a Principal Technical SEO, reporting directly to our Chief Gaming Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to take portfolio-wide responsibility for the technical SEO performance of some of the largest and most commercially important domains in iGaming. Working alongside our existing Principal Technical SEO, you will co-own technical SEO across our Gaming portfolio, while also supporting our Sports portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will identify the technical opportunities and risks that matter most, turn them into clear priorities, and work closely with Product and Engineering to deliver measurable organic and commercial impact. This is a deeply hands-on role where you will solve complex challenges across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, internationalisation, migrations and performance, while setting standards that scale across our portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also play a key role in advancing how we use AI and automation across SEO. You will build tools, monitoring, diagnostics and automated workflows yourself, using technology to improve the speed and quality of decision-making and helping our wider SEO teams adopt these capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with significant autonomy and visibility. You will lead through expertise rather than formal authority, working alongside senior specialists and leaders across SEO, Product, Engineering and Analytics to shape decisions across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, we value diverse perspectives and encourage you to apply even if you don't meet every qualification listed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own our portfolio-wide technical SEO strategy, roadmap and standards, identifying and prioritising the opportunities and risks with the greatest potential organic and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex technical investigations across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, international SEO, migrations, structured data and web performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering on architecture, major releases, migrations and experimentation, translating technical SEO insights into clear priorities and scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated monitoring, diagnostics and early-warning systems that identify material technical issues before they become significant commercial problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal tools and AI-enabled workflows that improve analysis, quality assurance, prioritisation and execution across technical SEO and the wider SEO organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable technical patterns, guardrails and frameworks across our portfolio, raising technical capability through coaching, documentation and shared tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repeated technical SEO impact at scale&lt;/strong&gt;- a strong track record of personally leading complex technical SEO initiatives across large websites or multi-domain portfolios, with clear evidence of measurable organic or commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional technical SEO depth and judgement&lt;/strong&gt;- expert knowledge across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, canonicalisation, international SEO, migrations, structured data, JavaScript SEO, log-file analysis and web performance, with the judgement to separate material opportunities from technical hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;- able to translate complex technical findings into priorities based on expected value, risk, effort, confidence and opportunity cost, connecting technical decisions to organic and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level influence&lt;/strong&gt;- experienced in influencing Product, Engineering and senior stakeholders without direct authority, challenging constructively and communicating complex technical decisions clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder's mindset&lt;/strong&gt;- intellectually curious, technically self-sufficient and comfortable remaining deeply hands-on while creating systems, standards and capabilities that increase the impact of teams beyond your own individual contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1st: Initial chat with our Talent Partner - 30 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2nd: Interview with our Chief Gaming Officer - 60 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3rd: Technical SEO interview with senior members of our SEO team - 60 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4th: Case presentation and Principal peer interview - 90 minutes via Zoom, including a technical SEO assessment prepared ahead of the interview.&lt;/p&gt;
